  },
  {
   "step": "Apply three listing rules",
   "body": "At 1 day a listing changes price only at its own past rate of change. Scaleway listings follow the ECB EUR/USD reference rate. A listing seen before returns at its posted price."
  },
  {
   "step": "Add the within-day data (member A)",
   "body": "The day's maximum price of a listing gives its next-day price where it has done so before. A listing seen in at most a quarter of the day's snapshots may leave the next day."
  },
  {
   "step": "Adjust candidate 1 with an LLM (member B)",
